 {"q": "Which text was Zwingli's key support?", "options": ["'This is my body'", "'My flesh is food indeed'", "'The flesh profits nothing; the words that I speak to you are spirit' (John 6:63)", "'The cup of blessing'"], "answer": 2, "why": "He read John 6 spiritually, with verse 63 as the key, and 'is' as 'signifies'."},
